        "en": "From the Bund, a transit route to the Shanghai International Circuit was measured at about 101 minutes (Metro Line 14 + Metro Line 11 + walk), and from the Hamilton-themed pop-up about 93 minutes (Metro Line 2 + Metro Line 11 + walk) [来源1]. The source notes these were measured on 2026-10-13 and advises allowing more time on race day [来源1]."
